<title>CANADA: Canada Sept natural gas sales rise 6.6 percent.</title>
<headline>Canada Sept natural gas sales rise 6.6 percent.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian sales of natural gas rose 6.6 percent in September from the same month a year earlier, to 3,769,506,000 cubic metres, Statistics Canada said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Thousands of cubic meters and percentage changes:</p>
<p>				     Sept 96     Sept 95	Pct</p>
<p>Total			     3,769,506    3,537,384   +6.6</p>
<p>Residential sales		 553,229	462,042  +19.7</p>
<p>Commercial sales		  428,849	372,007  +15.3</p>
<p>Industrial			1,807,940    1,806,333    n/a</p>
<p>Direct sales			979,488	897,002</p>
<p>(For more information from Statistics Canada, contact Gary Smalldridge, Energy Section, at 613-951-3567)</p>
<p>-- Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613 235-6745</p>
</text>
